node_modules/
*.keystore
*.jks
# android/ and ios/ (made by `cap add`) are meant to be committed once set
# up: the iOS widget target is added in Xcode and lives only there. Their
# own .gitignore files keep build output out.
# The shared DEBUG key used by CI so test APKs can update each other. Not a
# store key: Play Store builds use a private key kept off the repository.
!debug.keystore
